# Whitelist model: NOTHING at repo root is tracked except the website.
#
#   docs/  -> the live site, deployed to solaraiflow.com via GitHub Pages
#   everything else at root (research/, prospect lists, sales/, brand/,
#   scratch files, whatever we make) stays local automatically.
#
# To ship something, put it inside docs/. To keep it private, put it anywhere else.
/*
!/docs/
!/.gitignore
